From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:35:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] windows.ui: scheduled toasts, XmlDocument
 namespaces/PI/doctype/load settings, IInspectable answers

ScheduledToastNotification class (IScheduledToastNotification 1-4, factory
with the recurring form) and the ToastNotifier schedule: AddToSchedule /
RemoveFromSchedule / GetScheduledToastNotifications; a worker thread shows each
toast through the notifier at its delivery time (this process only; repeats
follow the snooze interval).
Windows.Data.Xml.Dom: SelectNodesNS / SelectSingleNodeNS (namespace
declarations string), Set/Get/RemoveAttributeNS, GetAttributeNodeNS,
CreateAttributeNS, Node.Prefix for elements, XmlProcessingInstruction,
XmlDocumentType, XmlDomImplementation.HasFeature, CreateEntityReference,
XmlLoadSettings class and LoadXmlWithSettings, SaveToFileAsync (writes the
file's path, returns a finished action). UIColorType values out of range
answer E_INVALIDARG. The UISettings factory is not agile (test ground truth).
New tests/xmldom.c.

